<title>MEXICO: Mexico not processing sorghum import permits - trade.</title>
<headline>Mexico not processing sorghum import permits - trade.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican authorities are not processing phytosanitary permits to import sorghum along the U.S. border, Mexican trade sources said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;They are receiving the permits but they are not processing and expediting them, it is a form of temporarily banning imports,&quot; one grains trader said, requesting anonymity.</p>
</text>
